#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:2
msgid "Serialization and Hashing"
msgstr "Serialització i hashing"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:4
msgid ""
"Almost every object in QiliSDK can be written to disk and read back, and "
"every object that takes part in symbolic expressions needs a hash that stays"
" the same across processes. Both of these are provided by "
":mod:`qilisdk.utils`."
msgstr ""
"Gairebé tots els objectes de QiliSDK es poden escriure a disc i tornar a "
"llegir, i tot objecte que participi en expressions simbòliques necessita un "
"hash que es mantingui igual entre processos. :mod:`qilisdk.utils` "
"proporciona totes dues coses."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:9
msgid "Serialization"
msgstr "Serialització"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:11
msgid ""
":mod:`qilisdk.utils.serialization` offers four entry-points, built on the "
"YAML handler in :mod:`qilisdk.yaml`:"
msgstr ""
":mod:`qilisdk.utils.serialization` ofereix quatre punts d'entrada, "
"construïts sobre el gestor de YAML de :mod:`qilisdk.yaml`:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:14
msgid ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.serialize` — serialize an object to a "
"YAML string."
msgstr ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.serialize` — serialitzar un objecte en "
"una cadena YAML."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:15
msgid ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.serialize_to` — serialize an object to a"
" YAML file."
msgstr ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.serialize_to` — serialitzar un objecte "
"en un fitxer YAML."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:16
msgid ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.deserialize` — rebuild an object from a "
"YAML string."
msgstr ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.deserialize` — reconstruir un objecte a "
"partir d'una cadena YAML."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:17
msgid ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.deserialize_from` — rebuild an object "
"from a YAML file."
msgstr ""
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.deserialize_from` — reconstruir un "
"objecte a partir d'un fitxer YAML."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:27
msgid "**Output**::"
msgstr "**Sortida**::"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:44
msgid ""
"Each ``!Tag`` in the output names the class that produced the node, which "
"allows the object graph to be rebuilt exactly."
msgstr ""
"Cada ``!Tag`` de la sortida anomena la classe que va produir el node, cosa "
"que permet reconstruir exactament el graf d'objectes."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:47
msgid "Writing to and reading from a file works in the same way:"
msgstr "Escriure en un fitxer i llegir-ne funciona de la mateixa manera:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:63
msgid "Checking the type on the way back"
msgstr "Comprovar el tipus a la tornada"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:65
msgid ""
"Both ``deserialize`` functions accept an optional class as their second "
"argument. When given, the rebuilt object is checked against it and the call "
"is typed as returning that class."
msgstr ""
"Totes dues funcions ``deserialize`` accepten una classe opcional com a segon"
" argument. Si s'indica, l'objecte reconstruït es comprova contra ella i la "
"crida queda tipada com si retornés aquesta classe."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:76
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Errors"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:78
msgid ""
"Failures are wrapped so that callers only have to catch two exceptions:"
msgstr ""
"Les fallades s'embolcallen perquè qui fa la crida només hagi de capturar "
"dues excepcions:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:80
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.SerializationError` — the object could "
"not be written."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.SerializationError` — no s'ha pogut "
"escriure l'objecte."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:81
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.DeserializationError` — the YAML could "
"not be parsed, or the result is not an instance of the requested class."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.serialization.DeserializationError` — no s'ha pogut "
"analitzar el YAML, o el resultat no és una instància de la classe "
"sol·licitada."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:84
msgid "Registering your own classes"
msgstr "Registrar les teves pròpies classes"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:86
msgid ""
"A class becomes serializable by registering it with the shared YAML handler."
" The decorator assigns the tag automatically from the class name, and every "
"public QiliSDK class that you can serialize uses it:"
msgstr ""
"Una classe esdevé serialitzable en registrar-la al gestor de YAML compartit."
" El decorador assigna l'etiqueta automàticament a partir del nom de la "
"classe, i totes les classes públiques de QiliSDK que pots serialitzar "
"l'utilitzen:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:99
msgid ""
"Pass ``shared=True`` to prefix the tag with the top-level package name, "
"which avoids collisions with tags defined elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Passa ``shared=True`` per anteposar a l'etiqueta el nom del paquet de nivell"
" superior, cosa que evita col·lisions amb etiquetes definides en un altre "
"lloc."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:104
msgid ""
"The handler is a ruamel ``YAML(typ=\"unsafe\")`` instance, so deserializing "
"constructs arbitrary Python objects named in the document. Only load files "
"you trust."
msgstr ""
"El gestor és una instància ``YAML(typ=\"unsafe\")`` de ruamel, així que "
"deserialitzar construeix objectes de Python arbitraris anomenats al "
"document. Carrega només fitxers en què confiïs."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:108
msgid "Hashing"
msgstr "Hashing"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:110
msgid ""
":func:`qilisdk.utils.hashing.hash` produces a stable hash for the objects "
"QiliSDK builds expressions out of. It is used by "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.BaseVariable`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.qtensor.QTensor`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.digital.circuit.Circuit` and the gates, so that terms can "
"be collected in dictionaries and compared reliably."
msgstr ""
":func:`qilisdk.utils.hashing.hash` produeix un hash estable per als objectes"
" amb què QiliSDK construeix expressions. L'utilitzen "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.BaseVariable`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.qtensor.QTensor`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.digital.circuit.Circuit` i les portes, de manera que els "
"termes es poden agrupar en diccionaris i comparar de manera fiable."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:122
msgid ""
"It differs from Python's built-in ``hash`` in two ways that matter here:"
msgstr ""
"Es diferencia del ``hash`` integrat de Python en dos aspectes que importen "
"aquí:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:124
msgid ""
"It is **stable across processes**. Python randomizes string hashing per "
"interpreter run, whereas this one is a `blake2b <https://www.blake2.net/>`_ "
"digest of a canonical encoding, so the same object hashes to the same "
"integer every time."
msgstr ""
"És **estable entre processos**. Python aleatoritza el hash de les cadenes a "
"cada execució de l'intèrpret, mentre que aquest és un resum `blake2b "
"<https://www.blake2.net/>`_ d'una codificació canònica, així que el mateix "
"objecte produeix sempre el mateix enter."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:125
msgid ""
"It is **consistent across numeric types**. Values are encoded as exact "
"integer ratios, so ``1``, ``1.0`` and ``(1+0j)`` all hash alike, and "
"``nan``, ``inf`` and NumPy scalars are handled explicitly."
msgstr ""
"És **coherent entre tipus numèrics**. Els valors es codifiquen com a raons "
"exactes d'enters, de manera que ``1``, ``1.0`` i ``(1+0j)`` produeixen el "
"mateix hash, i ``nan``, ``inf`` i els escalars de NumPy es tracten "
"explícitament."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_serialization.rst:129
msgid ""
"The returned integer is compatible with Python's ``__hash__`` protocol, so "
"it can be returned directly from a ``__hash__`` method. It is not a "
"cryptographic commitment and should not be used as one."
msgstr ""
"L'enter retornat és compatible amb el protocol ``__hash__`` de Python, així "
"que es pot retornar directament des d'un mètode ``__hash__``. No és un "
"compromís criptogràfic i no s'ha d'utilitzar com a tal."
